{"id":"sabedoria","lemma":"sabedoria","pos":"noun","rank":2619,"glosses":["wisdom","knowledge","scholarship"],"ipa":"/sɐ.bɨ.duˈɾi.ɐ/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"sabedorias"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/21/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-MedK1-sabedoria.wav","examples":[{"text":"Deve usar o dinheiro com sabedoria.","en":"You have to use the money wisely.","words":[{"g":"should","l":"dever"},{"g":"to use"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"money"},{"g":"with"},null]},{"text":"Adquirimos sabedoria com a idade.","en":"We gain wisdom with age.","words":[{"g":"to acquire","l":"adquirir"},null,{"g":"with"},{"g":"the / to"},{"g":"age"}]},{"text":"Façamos uso de nosso tempo com sabedoria.","en":"Let's make use of our time wisely.","words":[{"g":"to create","l":"fazer"},{"g":"use"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"ours being addressed)"},{"g":"time"},{"g":"with"},null]},{"text":"A sabedoria não reside apenas em conhecer fatos.","en":"Wisdom does not consist only in knowing facts.","words":[{"g":"the / to"},null,{"g":"not / no"},{"g":"to reside, dwell","l":"residir"},{"g":"only"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"to know"},{"g":"suit","l":"fato"}]},{"text":"Deves gastar dinheiro com sabedoria.","en":"You have to use the money wisely.","words":[{"g":"should","l":"dever"},{"g":"to spend"},{"g":"money"},{"g":"with"},null]}]}